## Local discovery (cities and businesses)

Booksy listing pages are organized by locale, service category, and city/region. Use the patterns below to reach city-level and business-level pages beyond the top-level category links in each language section.

### URL patterns
- Category (country-wide): `https://booksy.com/{locale}/s/{category-slug}/`
- Category in a city: `https://booksy.com/{locale}/s/{category-slug}/{regionId}_{city-slug}/`
- All services in a city: `https://booksy.com/{locale}/s/{regionId}_{city-slug}/`
- Business profile: `https://booksy.com/{locale}/{businessId}_{businessSlug}_{categorySlug}_{regionId}_{city-slug}/`

`{locale}` examples: `en-us`, `pl-pl`, `es-es`, `en-gb`, `fr-fr`. `{regionId}` is a numeric region identifier; `{city-slug}` is a lowercase, hyphenated city name.

